{"id":840,"date":"2025-08-22T10:25:09","date_gmt":"2025-08-22T10:25:09","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/bombayfoodstuff\/?post_type=product&#038;p=840"},"modified":"2025-08-29T06:22:49","modified_gmt":"2025-08-29T06:22:49","slug":"walnut","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/product\/walnut\/","title":{"rendered":"Walnut"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2><b>Walnut<\/b><\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Name:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Walnut<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Botanical Name:<\/b> <i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Juglans regia<\/span><\/i>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Family Name:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Juglandaceae<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Commercial Part:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Kernel (nut)<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><b>Product Description<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Walnuts are nutrient-rich nuts enclosed in a hard brown shell with kernels shaped like butterfly lobes. Revered both for their ornamental trees and edible kernels, walnuts are harvested in winter but available year-round. They are widely used in snacks, bakery items, confectionery, and gourmet cooking. Their mild, earthy taste and crunchy texture make them a global favorite.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Applications<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Consumed as a healthy snack, raw or roasted<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Widely used in bakery products, chocolates, and confectionery<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Added to salads, breakfast cereals, and dairy preparations<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Used in sauces, desserts, and festive cuisines<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cold-pressed walnut oil used in cooking and cosmetics<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><b>Nutritional &amp; Health Benefits<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Rich source of omega-3 fatty acids for heart and brain health<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Packed with protein, fiber, magnesium, and antioxidants<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Supports bone strength and reduces inflammation<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Promotes improved memory and cognitive function<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Helps regulate cholesterol and blood pressure<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><b>Why Choose Bombay Foodstuff Walnuts?<\/b><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sourced from the finest walnut-producing regions<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fresh, premium-quality kernels with superior taste<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hygienically processed and packed for long shelf life<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ideal for both retail and bulk requirements<\/span>&nbsp;<\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Trusted supplier committed to global quality standards<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":fa